<title>UK: LME copper spikes as backwardation widens.</title>
<headline>LME copper spikes as backwardation widens.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Up around $25 at $2,425 as nearby backwardations tighten. Cash to threes at $140/$145, versus $130. Targets $2,430.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Stable after stocks fall.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Steady despite stocks rise, Inco tentative settlement.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Quiet.</p>
</text>
